  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): Under AU-C 315.A128, the completeness assertion addresses whether all transactions, events, and disclosures that should be included in the financial statements have been recorded. In a heavily regulated industry with frequent regulatory changes, the greatest risk is that required disclosures or transactions may be omitted because management may not keep pace with evolving requirements.
