  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under AU-C 530.A21, difference estimation multiplies the average difference between audited and book values by the population size to estimate total misstatement. It is most appropriate when misstatements exist in the sample and are relatively consistent in absolute size rather than proportional to book values.
